5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! Let's figure this out so we can all get along again. I want to see how others do it.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. I hope we can find a solution that makes everyone feel comfortable.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a sustainable system. I am concerned about the actual labor involved in maintaining the point.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want it to be fair! Like, really fair! No one should have to do more work just because of where they live.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us look at the facts first. I am curious about the financial side of things.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, I agree! Fairness is key. Maybe we should check out the other blocks to see their secrets?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a lovely idea, Kenji. I wonder what the daily experience is like for those neighbors.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, observing others is fine, but we need hard data on the time commitment required for these tasks.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know exactly how big everyone's front yard is! That's where the bins go, right?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A house is more than its measurements, Rin, but numbers do provide a foundation for a peaceful agreement.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the station block's bin house! I bet it's cool. And maybe the meeting minutes?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think I shall look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the station block's bin house too.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log for this point!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall examine the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
