35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, the station block's bin house smells bad and they're fighting! Maybe a fancy house isn't the answer.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, it seems a shelter might just hide the problem rather than solve it. We must be careful.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The filing process for a permanent structure is tedious and takes months. We should consider the administrative burden.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,I found out that some of our frontages are way smaller than others! It's not fair to just pick a spot!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,It is often the hidden costs that weigh most heavily on a household. We must consider the budget of all.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, we can find a way to make it fair! Maybe we can rotate the spot?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,Rotating might be stressful for some. I worry about the daily burden on our neighbors.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, rotating requires constant coordination. Who will manage the schedule? That is where the real cost lies.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,But the complaint log says the person with the bins is the one complaining the most! They're tired of it!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Anger is just a cry for help. If we share the burden, the anger will fade into harmony.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I just want us to be friends again. If we pick something easy, maybe we can stop arguing?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Kenji. A gentle approach is always best. Let's look for the path of least resistance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,Ease is a temporary feeling. I want a system that doesn't rely on one person's willingness to answer the phone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to sign anything that just leaves the bins in the same place forever! That's not a new plan!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us remember that money is a tool, not a master. We must ensure no one is strained by the cost.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
