60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I don't like Option A because the other block is fighting over their house. Let's go with B or C!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I am afraid Option A might bring a lingering smell, and Option B might be too disruptive for some.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is a bureaucratic nightmare. Option B requires constant management. Option C is the most logical if the window is strict.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is just leaving it where it is! No way! I vote for B because everyone takes a turn!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"A permanent structure is a heavy financial burden, even with a subsidy. We must be mindful of our neighbors' pockets.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if we do B, will everyone be happy? I think it's the most fair way to make peace!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I worry that moving the bins every few weeks will just move the stress from one person to another.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, you are correct. Option B doesn't reduce the work; it just distributes the annoyance. Option C is more efficient.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,But Option C still leaves the bins at the same house! That's not fair to the person who's been complaining!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Fairness is not always about equal space, but about equal ease. Let us think of the heart, not just the map.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I think B is the best for our friendship. It shows we're all in this together!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I feel that Option C, with a little kindness and help from each other, might be the most peaceful.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Option C is the only one that minimizes the long-term administrative and physical labor. I vote for C.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm sticking with B! It's the only one that actually moves the bins!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I cannot support the high cost of A. Between B and C, C is more sustainable for those on a tight budget.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
